# graphify ignore — keep the knowledge graph focused on code architecture.
#
# NOTE: graphify reads .graphifyignore *instead of* .gitignore at a given
# directory (not in addition). So this file intentionally restates the
# graph-relevant .gitignore exclusions, then adds the noise that .gitignore
# does NOT exclude but which drowns code queries (i18n key dumps, generated
# clients). node_modules/dist/build/.turbo/coverage/graphify-out etc. are
# already hard-skipped by graphify's built-in _SKIP_DIRS, so they're omitted.
# Keep roughly in sync with .gitignore for the entries below.

# ── The actual problem: i18n locale files ───────────────────────────────
# Each locale JSON is a flat dump of translation keys; graphify turns every
# key into a node, so a handful of namespaces × 4 locales = hundreds of
# low-value nodes that dominate BFS/explain and bury real TS symbols.
apps/*/public/locales/
apps/api/locales/
packages/i18n/locales/

# ── Generated code (huge, not authored) ─────────────────────────────────
apps/api/src/generated/

# ── Restated from .gitignore (graph-relevant) ───────────────────────────
logs
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.*.example
infrastructure/
_bmad/
_bmad-output/
.bmad/
.bmad-method/
**/bmad-*.md
**/BMAD-*.md
docs/architecture
docs/development
.claude/skills/
.claude/worktrees/
.impeccable.md
qarote-license-*.json
license.json
*.tsbuildinfo
apps/api/src/ee/services/llm/__evals__/eval-result.json
apps/api/src/ee/services/llm/__evals__/.promptfoo/
